+# Root independent local-observable approximation route
+
+Root independently derived the face-chain recursion and projected finite-energy bound before reading primary35 proof. Candidate exposure: primary independently reported the same safe32e velocity and polynomial ballsize before this durable write; no primary proof or checker was read. Root's additional candidates below are frozen before new checks and before sending them to primary.
+
+Use infinite-cubic link adjacency (two links adjacent iff sharing a plaquette), X observable support, Omega=B_r(X) intersect any finite ambient graph. Each link touches at most4faces, eachface4links. Bounded centeredinteraction norm<=v and onsite electric interaction-picture support unchanged. Strictcommutator recursion yields safe tail2||A||||B|| |X| Theta_d(32vT), Theta_d(z)=sum_(n>=d)z^n/n!. BoundaryDuhamel with Ncross<=4N yields sharper integrated error ||A|| |X|N Theta_(r+1)(32vT)/4; this is zero atv0. Ballsize N<=3|X|(2r+1)^3. Finite-region positivepotential norm M<=2v Nfaces<=2vN.
